#wave4
clear
use CHARLS
keep ID communityID province city householdID inw4 r4agey ragender raeducl r4shlta hh4itot h4hhres r4work r4retemp r4hibpe r4diabe r4cancre r4lunge r4hearte r4stroke r4asthmae r4mstat r4whappyl r4cesd10 r4satlife r4smoken r4drinkn_c r4vgactx_c r4mdactx_c r4itearn hh4ctot r4ser7 r4orient r4imrc r4dlrc
gen wave4=4 if inw4==1
drop if wave4==.
