#merge
clear
use wave1_junk
append using wave2_junk
append using wave3_junk
append using wave4_junk
sort ID wave
save alljunk

clear
use xcountry_digital
drop if wave==.
tab wave,m
merge 1:1 ID wave using alljunk
rename _merge merge5
tab wave merge5, m
 
erase wave1_junk
erase wave2_junk
erase wave3_junk
erase wave4_junk
erase alljunk

save xcountry_digital, replace

